# Product requirements

## Problem and evidence
Describe the user problem and cite supplied brief or inspected evidence.

## Users and constraints
List user jobs and known constraints; mark gaps Unresolved.

## Scope
Separate in-scope from excluded capabilities.

## Functional requirements
Define stable REQ-### records, priority, rationale and acceptance links.

## Non-functional requirements
Define NFR-### and measurable validation method; do not invent baselines.

## Open decisions
Record unresolved choices, evidence needed and owner only if known.
